SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

The MIT terms above cover the SOFTWARE in this repository: everything under
`code/`, `rescore_with_fixed_parser.py`, and the build/CI configuration.

They do NOT cover the third-party exam content in `data/`. The 315 multiple-choice
items in `data/questions-ope-300-clean.xlsx` are reproduced from published Galicia
(SERGAS) public-employment specialist examinations (OPE 2016 / 2019 / 2022) for the
specialty *aparato digestivo*. Those items are the work of their original authors
and are included here solely as the evaluation set required to reproduce the
published results. No claim of ownership or additional license is asserted over
them, and downstream reuse of the question bank is the reuser's responsibility.

See `data/README.md` for full data provenance.
